  "semantics": [
    "Read all three material source modules, both new test files, complete owned and host patches, owner witness/runtime capture/contribution consumers, host composition hunks and public ToolSafety/ToolRegistry settlement boundaries.",
    "Authentication origin is a private optional host capability. Exact original POST Request and UI context identity, exact routines.run intent, stable origin binding and current principal/access/policy/provider generation are required. IDs/plan.owner only compare canonical observations; they do not issue authority.",
    "Admission invokes captureSfRoutineNativeOwner and yields the existing effect once. It neither creates a Task nor issues a core frame, grants Permission, inserts approval or dispatches a coordinator. sf_maestro remains separate from native maestro.",
    "Registry claims replay before governance.tryBind. tryBind is synchronous and refuses occupied/aborted leases without revoking the first caller. The old bind replacement contract remains for existing private consumers.",
